    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>20+ new color schemes for your admin with ability to assign color schemes to user roles.</p>\n<h3>Source Code</h3>\n<p>The uncompiled versions of the JavaScript and CSS files can be found in the following locations within this plugin:<br />\n&#8211; Admin JavaScript: <code>assets/admin/admin.js</code>, <code>assets/admin/settings-page/scripts.js</code><br />\n&#8211; Admin CSS: <code>assets/admin/admin.scss</code>, <code>assets/admin/settings-page/styles.scss</code><br />\n&#8211; Editor CSS: <code>assets/editor.scss</code><br />\n&#8211; Schemes CSS: <code>assets/schemes/</code></p>\n<p>All non-distributed files are located in the <code>assets/</code> directory. The compiled files are output to the <code>dist/</code> directory.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<p>1.0.2</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Added colors &#8220;Mist marine&#8221;, &#8220;Emerald coast&#8221;, &#8220;Petal passion&#8221; and &#8220;Vintage garden&#8221;.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>1.0.1</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Added colors &#8220;Fresh&#8221;, &#8220;Blue&#8221;, &#8220;Beach ball&#8221; and &#8220;Premium&#8221;.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>1.0.0</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial Release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Some new and role based color schemes for your WordPress site.",
    "description": "<p>20+ new color schemes for your admin with ability to assign color schemes to user roles.</p>\n<h3>Source Code</h3>\n<p>The uncompiled versions of the JavaScript and CSS files can be found in the following locations within this plugin:<br />\n&#8211; Admin JavaScript: <code>assets/admin/admin.js</code>, <code>assets/admin/settings-page/scripts.js</code><br />\n&#8211; Admin CSS: <code>assets/admin/admin.scss</code>, <code>assets/admin/settings-page/styles.scss</code><br />\n&#8211; Editor CSS: <code>assets/editor.scss</code><br />\n&#8211; Schemes CSS: <code>assets/schemes/</code></p>\n<p>All non-distributed files are located in the <code>assets/</code> directory. The compiled files are output to the <code>dist/</code> directory.</p>\n",
